  "vv70:0.4": "6. Bhikkhādāyakavimānavatthu 1081. ",
  "vv70:1.1": "‘‘Uccamidaṃ maṇithūṇaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv70:1.2": "samantato dvādasa yojanāni; ",
  "vv70:1.3": "Kūṭāgārā sattasatā uḷārā, ",
  "vv70:1.4": "veḷuriyathambhā rucakatthatā subhā. ",
  "vv70:2.1": "1082. ‘‘Deviddhipattosi mahānubhāvo, ",
  "vv70:2.2": "manussabhūto kimakāsi puññaṃ; ",
  "vv70:2.3": "Kenāsi evaṃ jalitānubhāvo, ",
  "vv70:2.4": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv70:3.1": "1083. So devaputto attamano ",
  "vv70:3.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv70:3.3": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv70:4.1": "1084. ‘‘Ahaṃ manussesu manussabhūto, ",
  "vv70:4.2": "disvāna bhikkhuṃ tasitaṃ kilantaṃ; ",
  "vv70:4.3": "Ekāhaṃ bhikkhaṃ paṭipādayissaṃ, ",
  "vv70:4.4": "samaṅgi bhattena tadā akāsiṃ. ",
  "vv70:5.1": "1085. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo ",
  "vv70:5.2": "…pe… ",
  "vv70:5.3": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv70:6.1": "Bhikkhādāyakavimānaṃ chaṭṭhaṃ. "
}
